    \limsup_{n\to\infty}|\esp{\theta_n} - \theta^* | \le C \alpha\qquad \mathrm{and}\qquad 
    \limsup_{n\to\infty}|\esp{(\theta_n- \theta^*)^2} | \le C \alpha.
\end{align*}

\begin{align*}
